---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "About"
description: "Few things about me."
---
<section class="space-y-4">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8 md:items-start">
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 mb-6 md:mb-0 flex justify-center md:justify-start">
        {% image "./src/assets/img/shajan-jacob-portrait.jpg", "Portrait of Shajan Jacob", "(max-width: 768px) 160px, 192px", "w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 rounded-2xl object-cover border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 brightness-[0.92] hover:brightness-100 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-400 transition-all duration-700 ease-out" %}
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <p class="text-2xl font-medium mb-8">Hello,</p>

        <p>I'm Shajan Jacob - a software engineer and technical lead based in Kochi, India, with over 8 years of experience designing and building production-grade web applications.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<p>I specialize in backend engineering with <strong>Node.js</strong>, <strong>TypeScript</strong>, and <strong>NestJS</strong>, architecting scalable microservices and real-time systems on <strong>Google Cloud Platform</strong> and <strong>AWS</strong>. My work spans high-throughput APIs, event-driven architectures, and full-stack development - from ideation through deployment and beyond.</p>

<p>Currently, I serve as <strong>Technical Lead at <a href="https://www.soricesolutions.com/" target="_blank" class="link">Sorice Solutions</a></strong>, where I lead architecture decisions, mentor engineers, optimize system performance, and drive end-to-end project delivery. Previously, I was a <strong>Software Engineer at <a href="https://cubettech.com/" target="_blank" class="link">Cubet Techno Labs</a></strong>, where I built APIs, microservices, and serverless solutions, and published the <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/ffmpeg-sdk" target="_blank" class="link">ffmpeg-sdk</a> npm package.

<p>Beyond the keyboard, I'm deeply curious about hardware. The green traces on circuit boards fascinated me as a child, and that curiosity grew into a passion for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_of_Things" target="_blank" class="link">IoT</a> and building things with <a href="https://www.raspberrypi.org/" target="_blank" class="link">Raspberry Pi</a>, ESP32, and addressable LEDs. I've built everything from internet-connected Christmas stars to smart AC controllers - blending software with the physical world.</p>

<p>When I'm not coding or tinkering, you'll find me spending time with family, reading a good book, shooting <a class="link" href="/photography/">photographs</a>, or getting lost on the internet learning something new.</p>

<p>I believe great engineering is about people as much as code - whether it's mentoring junior developers, collaborating with cross-functional teams, or building tools that make someone's day a little easier.</p>

<p>I also maintain a <a href="/shelf/" class="link">shelf</a> of books and a <a href="/uses/" class="link">uses</a> page with the tools and gadgets I rely on - take a peek if you're curious.</p>

<p>Want to work together or just say hello? <a href="/contact" class="link">Get in touch</a>.</p>

<!-- Timeline excerpt: latest 10 events -->
<div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">The Journey So Far</h2>
        <a href="/timeline/" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-200">
            See more &rarr;
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
        <!-- Vertical line -->
        <div class="absolute left-[11px] top-[13px] bottom-2 w-px bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-700"></div>

        <!-- Start ring -->
        <div class="absolute left-[5px] top-0 w-[13px] h-[13px] rounded-full border-2 border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-600 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950"></div>

        <!-- End ring -->
        <div class="absolute left-[5px] bottom-2 w-[13px] h-[13px] rounded-full border-2 border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-600 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950"></div>

        <div class="space-y-0 pt-8">
            {% for item in collections.timeline %}{% if loop.index <= 10 %}
            <div class="relative py-3 flex items-start" data-type="{{ item.type }}">
                <!-- Icon column -->
                <div class="w-10 flex-shrink-0 flex items-start pt-0.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 ml-[1px] rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full rounded-full
                            {% if item.type === 'blog' %}bg-sky-500/20
                            {% elseif item.type === 'photo' %}bg-emerald-500/20
                            {% elseif item.type === 'personal' %}bg-indigo-500/20
                            {% else %}bg-amber-500/20
                            {% endif %}">
                            {% if item.type === 'blog' %}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3 h-3 text-sky-500">
                                <path d="M17 3a2.85 2.85 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z"/>
                            </svg>
                            {% elseif item.type === 'photo' %}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-500">
                                <path d="M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z"/>
                                <circle cx="12" cy="13" r="2.5"/>
                            </svg>
                            {% elseif item.type === 'personal' %}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3 h-3 text-indigo-500">
                                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                                <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/>
                                <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/>
                                <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
                            </svg>
                            {% else %}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3 h-3 text-amber-500">
                                <path d="M20 20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.69-.9L9.6 3.9A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2Z"/>
                            </svg>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Content column -->
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold leading-[16px]">
                        {{ item.itemDate | humanDateDayMonth }}
                    </div>

                    {% if item.url and item.url != '#' %}
                    <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="block group mt-0.5">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-medium leading-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:underline transition-all duration-200 break-words flex items-center gap-2">
                            {% if item.data.icon and (item.type === 'blog' or item.type === 'project') %}
                            <img src="{{ item.url }}{{ item.data.icon }}" alt=""
                                width="64" height="64"
                                class="w-4 h-auto flex-shrink-0 invert-40 dark:invert-70"
                            >
                            {% elseif item.data.image and item.type === 'photo' %}
                            <img src="{{ item.data.image | replace('./src/', '/') }}" alt=""
                                width="64" height="64"
                                class="w-4 h-4 object-cover rounded flex-shrink-0"
                            >
                            {% endif %}
                            {{ item.data.title }}
                        </h3>
                    </a>
                    {% else %}
                    <span class="block mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-base font-medium leading-tight text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
                            {{ item.data.title }}
                        </span>
                    </span>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800">
    {% include "components/social-links.njk" %}
</div>
</section>
